cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, together with the FEPO article."
title: "PreFEPO: preprocessing for FEPO"
abstract: "PreFEPO cleans and harmonises the sandfly trap records and extracts the meteorological, hydrological and morphological predictors at the trap sites and dates, producing the training tables of FEPO."
